케이션이다. 이러한 애플리케이","words":[{"text":"된","x":554,"y":2361,"width":31,"height":37},{"text":"표준","x":599,"y":2363,"width":68,"height":34},{"text":"프로토콜을","x":679,"y":2360,"width":169,"height":37},{"text":"구현하는","x":860,"y":2358,"width":135,"height":40},{"text":"클라이언트-서버","x":1007,"y":2358,"width":261,"height":38},{"text":"애플리케이션이다.","x":1286,"y":2356,"width":286,"height":39},{"text":"이러한","x":1590,"y":2357,"width":105,"height":37},{"text":"애플리케이","x":1708,"y":2357,"width":165,"height":39}]},{"text":"션은 때때로 “개방형(叩en)”이라고 불리는데, 그 동작을 규정하는 규칙들이 모두에게","words":[{"text":"션은","x":555,"y":2421,"width":67,"height":37},{"text":"때때로","x":638,"y":2421,"width":100,"height":37},{"text":"“개방형(叩en)”이라고","x":752,"y":2419,"width":331,"height":43},{"text":"불리는데,","x":1097,"y":2418,"width":145,"height":39},{"text":"그","x":1259,"y":2424,"width":34,"height":26},{"text":"동작을","x":1307,"y":2417,"width":106,"height":39},{"text":"규정하는","x":1428,"y":2417,"width":142,"height":38},{"text":"규칙들이","x":1585,"y":2417,"width":137,"height":39},{"text":"모두에게","x":1742,"y":2417,"width":132,"height":40}]},{"text":"알려져 있기 때문이다. 그 경우, 클라이언트와 서버 프로그램은 RFC에 정의된 규칙을","words":[{"text":"알려져","x":556,"y":2482,"width":97,"height":38},{"text":"있기","x":672,"y":2482,"width":61,"height":38},{"text":"때문이다.","x":752,"y":2481,"width":140,"height":38},{"text":"그","x":908,"y":2486,"width":33,"height":26},{"text":"경우,","x":957,"y":2480,"width":73,"height":38},{"text":"클라이언트와","x":1045,"y":2480,"width":205,"height":38},{"text":"서버","x":1263,"y":2479,"width":63,"height":39},{"text":"프로그램은","x":1344,"y":2479,"width":176,"height":38},{"text":"RFC에","x":1533,"y":2479,"width":109,"height":39},{"text":"정의된","x":1661,"y":2480,"width":102,"height":39},{"text":"규칙을","x":1779,"y":2479,"width":99,"height":39}]},{"text":"따라야 한다. 예를 들어, 클라이언트 프로그램은 HTTP 프로토콜의 클라이언트 측을","words":[{"text":"따라야","x":558,"y":2543,"width":101,"height":39},{"text":"한다.","x":674,"y":2542,"width":74,"height":38},{"text":"예를","x":768,"y":2542,"width":66,"height":37}